/Title (The pre-implementation phase focuses on the preparation and planning of the action research. As pre-service teachers assigned at Pres. Diosdado Macapagal High School, the researchers observed the current practices in student attendance and exit-and-return logging within their assigned classrooms. Based on these observations, the researchers identified the need for a more efficient and organized system for monitoring student attendance and movement. )
